    "sha256": "860063cf6bfe2c120c4a61c92f96b1f295d7f6e20944547b007b4849d0eb5386",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 1,
    "speaker": "Casey",
    "voice": "am_puck",
    "text": "The sales team argues that postponing would damage the client relationship.",
    "bytes": 34028,
    "sha256": "7a2ad2b97dd3c794676cc9ae9c18f58e4df0be43330d1a6f07737dc24e3ccaf8",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 2,
    "speaker": "Morgan",
    "voice": "af_nicole",
    "text": "That is a real concern, although it does not remove our responsibility to disclose limitations.",
    "bytes": 71660,
    "sha256": "9e2491b885aeb0a3e332e60134096b4531f2ee7111bf87b96a15d609ed027303",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 3,
    "speaker": "Casey",
    "voice": "am_puck",
    "text": "Do the existing results establish that there is a defect?",
    "bytes": 26540,
    "sha256": "00a45578702675f6ecc0a39c6370cbc51a1733522e8f4e441b7caf803c38f327",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 4,
    "speaker": "Morgan",
    "voice": "af_nicole",
    "text": "No. They leave a question unanswered. We should avoid presenting uncertainty as either proof of safety or proof of failure.",
    "bytes": 92012,
    "sha256": "77cde41e3081453a431b7adc2e8bfd53ad801e879d362d630011b1e93d29cf17",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 5,
    "speaker": "Casey",
    "voice": "am_puck",
    "text": "Then a proportionate response might be a limited trial with explicit conditions.",
    "bytes": 38636,
    "sha256": "3a27377d3af4949ef89578166dd1d5046c0c8a81d388664e9794ec8509d36ccb",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 6,
    "speaker": "Morgan",
    "voice": "af_nicole",
    "text": "Possibly, but only if the unresolved check does not concern a safety-critical requirement.",
    "bytes": 69740,
    "sha256": "bb560c7269a3c7190cdec6f3f0761ea6ef8da0737cd5f1ef2271a88e46c288d2",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 7,
    "speaker": "Casey",
    "voice": "am_puck",
    "text": "Agreed. Due diligence means establishing that distinction before recommending the trial.",
    "bytes": 43244,
    "sha256": "05f94571731c0f437b48fc34e99e49c7a8d734976d67a8fec1764ea336bd089e",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 8,
    "speaker": "Morgan",
    "voice": "af_nicole",
    "text": "We should also disclose that the sales lead receives a bonus if the launch goes ahead.",
    "bytes": 63596,
    "sha256": "811c14b299358a3e71a700c0ada9161dd0595df290ea4732f27b688eddd36baa",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 9,
    "speaker": "Casey",
    "voice": "am_puck",
    "text": "That conflict of interest does not automatically invalidate the argument, but it needs transparent handling.",
    "bytes": 50540,
    "sha256": "a5ba8906188989fb06bf4bcf7e1a3cd2a0df224a04680f8632ac9640193a2539",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 10,
    "speaker": "Morgan",
    "voice": "af_nicole",
    "text": "If we had explained the limitation earlier, the client could have planned alternatives.",
    "bytes": 57068,
    "sha256": "60441560dfc593f31ca4fecde3cb738f9cecb2e724eb5c6e99a1256a66988492",
    "humanReviewed": false
  },
  {
    "app": "business",
    "unitId": "ethical-decisions",
    "kind": "turn",
    "turn": 11,
    "speaker": "Casey",
    "voice": "am_puck",
    "text": "We cannot change that now. We can provide the evidence, the missing information and a realistic contingency.",
    "bytes": 54572,
